            <div xml:id="d502">

                <pb facs="0620" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg526"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">702.1211 Laredo/32: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Governor of
                        Texas</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Moody</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-01-06">January 6, 1930</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your wire January 4th is clear and to the point and greatly strengthens our
                    position with Mexico.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. P. Cotton</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
